# CVE-2026-97054 (GHSA-rg98-f588-44xg, Go stdlib HTTP/1 MaxBytesReader)
# Decided 2026-11-19, user, dialogue, PR #480: accepted risk.
# Affects the bundled trivy and grype binaries, built with Go 1.27.3. The fix is in Go 1.27.4
# and 1.26.11, which are published, but no bundled scanner is rebuilt on them yet.
# Reason: dockward does not run an HTTP/1 server that uses MaxBytesReader; the scanners run
# only as one-shot commands (backend/src/services/scanner/mod.rs scan_args).
# Removal: delete this entry when Trivy or Grype is rebuilt on Go 1.27.4 or later.
CVE-2026-97054
